        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: वगळणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वगळणे — vagaḷṇe — \"to leave out; to omit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अहवालातून त्याने महत्त्वाचा भाग वगळला. ahvālātūn tyāne mahattvācā bhāg vagaḷlā. He left an important part out of the report."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने वगळलं, tyāne vagaḷlaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The source takes -तून; वगळता, except."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वगळणे (vagaḷṇe) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Marathi vagaḷṇẽ, \"to drop disregardfully, cast out, omit\", under Sanskrit avagalati, \"falls down, slips down\" (CDIAL 742)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
