          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "समाविष्ट करणे — samāviṣṭa karṇe — \"to include\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नव्या अभ्यासक्रमात पर्यावरणाचा विषय समाविष्ट केला आहे. navyā abhyāsakramāt paryāvarṇācā viṣay samāviṣṭa kelā āhe. The environment has been included in the new syllabus."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने समाविष्ट केलं, tyāne samāviṣṭa kelaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Where it goes takes -त: अभ्यासक्रमात समाविष्ट."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "समाविष्ट करणे (samāviṣṭa karṇe) joins the tatsama समाविष्ट, Sanskrit samāviṣṭa, \"entered, filled\" (Monier-Williams), to करणे, \"to make\"."
            }
          ]
        },
